#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""App Store — the whole Flathub catalog (3000+ apps) plus Arch packages.

Discover page with a featured app and rows, categories, instant search, an app page
with screenshots and description, Installed and Updates. Installing happens in the
window with a progress bar (Flathub: per user, no password; Arch: pkexec).
"""
